Recommends: icewm | kde-plasma-desktop
Suggests: wireplumber | pulseaudio-utils, network-manager-gnome, pavucontrol, plasma-systemmonitor | gnome-system-monitor
Description: lightweight X11/Wayland dock for AI Workspace
 XDock is a compact Qt Quick dock. On X11 it advertises an EWMH dock
 window and reserves its visible edge with _NET_WM_STRUT_PARTIAL;
 on Wayland it uses the layer-shell protocol when available.
